---
layout: base.njk
title: Past Productions
description: A look back at past shows, music, art and events at PACA in downtown Erie.
---
<section class="page-head">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow"><span class="label">The history wall</span></div>
    <h1>Past <em>productions</em></h1>
    <p class="lede">A running record of what's happened on and around our stage. Older seasons are still being added.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="block">
  <div class="wrap">
    {% if collections.pastByYear.length %}
    {% for grp in collections.pastByYear %}
    <div class="arc-year rv">
      <h2 class="arc-yr">{{ grp.year }}</h2>
      <div class="arc-grid">
        {% for it in grp.items %}
        <div class="arc-item">
          {% if it.image %}<div class="arc-thumb" style="background-image:url({{ it.image }})"></div>{% else %}<div class="arc-thumb arc-noimg" style="background:linear-gradient(150deg,var(--ink-3),{{ it.discipline | disccolor }})"><span>{{ it.discipline }}</span></div>{% endif %}
          <div class="arc-body">
            <span class="arc-disc">{{ it.discipline }}</span>
            <h3>{% if it.url %}<a href="{{ it.url }}">{{ it.title }}</a>{% else %}{{ it.title }}{% endif %}</h3>
            {% if it.blurb %}<p>{{ it.blurb }}</p>{% endif %}
          </div>
        </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
    {% else %}
    <p style="color:var(--fog);font-size:1.1rem">The archive is just getting started. Check back soon.</p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>
